From 14f0725d1f6848cf59cb4c8003cb553a15cf3bd8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DongDongJu <commisori28@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:18:34 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add native MP KV bindings and CPU event draining to
 LMCache radix cache

Prepare STORE bindings with SGLang's native page hashing and shared signed
identity conversion. Extend hashes only for new request pages and release
request metadata on completion, independent of the selected TreeCore backend.
Drain committed CPU transitions through the existing scheduler publisher while
preserving GPU events. Reject unsupported namespaces in the tokenizer process
so invalid requests receive an error without terminating the scheduler.

Co-authored-by: Dongjoo Seo <dongjoo.seo1@samsung.com>
Signed-off-by: DongDongJu <commisori28@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Dongjoo Seo <dongjoo.seo1@samsung.com>
